# Supplement to octapede_forced.con: repeat Create on an active controller and
# deliver Landed while attached, bouncing-with-budget and bouncing-without-budget.
@f120 god 1
@f130 tp -198 119 -124
@f140 face 270
@f180 send u0483 Create; send u0483 Landed; send u0483 Landed; send u0483 Landed
@f300 damage u0483 1
@f320 damage u0483 1 light
@f340 damage u0480 1 dark
@f360 shoot u0474 charged
@f500 kill u0467
@f520 kill u0487
@f540 kill u045a
@f560 kill u043c
@f800 objs Octapede
@f1000 objs Octapede
